## About Allen

I'm Allen. I teach Chinese and Tai Chi to people outside China, in clear English, at a slow pace — one sentence, one movement, one day at a time. [More about Allen](/about/).

Everything on this site is free for now. Course collections and one-to-one online lessons will come later, once these sections have built up. For now, just follow along — and [contact Allen](/contact/) if you want to say hello or tell him what you would like to learn: Chinese, Tai Chi, or both.
